<title>USA: Raychem increases qtly dividend to $0.14.</title>
<headline>Raychem increases qtly dividend to $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raychem Corp said its board elected to increase its quarterly dividend by 40 percent to $0.14 per share payable on March 12, 1997, to stockholders of record as of February 12, 1997.</p>
</text>
